# C2 allow-list for mlmf-hf-config. One entry per direct dependency, sorted.
#
# mlmf-core alone, deliberately (C4): this crate reads a `MetadataSource`, so it
# works over `mlmf-hf-layout`s `ConfigJson` or any other source WITHOUT naming
# the layout crate. A format-axis crate depending on another format crate is
# what C4 exists to prevent. (The PM suggested depending on mlmf-hf-layout;
# this achieves the same reuse of ConfigJson without the edge.)
mlmf-core
